[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11161.83, "timestamp": "03:06:01", "text": "杰克，你得像个360度无瞄准镜一样操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11164.55, "timestamp": "03:06:04", "text": "为了这。给我，等等，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11167.03, "timestamp": "03:06:07", "text": "正在做。好的。好的。我正在做。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11169.269, "timestamp": "03:06:09", "text": "我打算这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11171.67, "timestamp": "03:06:11", "text": "你们想降低标准吗？还是你们想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11175.51, "timestamp": "03:06:15", "text": "进去吗？好的。我做了360度旋转。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11178.71, "timestamp": "03:06:18", "text": "好的。和董事会一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11182.469, "timestamp": "03:06:22", "text": "好的。 10月14日。这并不容易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11184.75, "timestamp": "03:06:24", "text": "为召唤仪式聚集山羊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11188.79, "timestamp": "03:06:28", "text": "仪式。幸好我有很多该死的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11191.91, "timestamp": "03:06:31", "text": "哦，是吗？是的。该死。嘿，我开始了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11194.15, "timestamp": "03:06:34", "text": "想知道这样做是否是个好主意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11196.389, "timestamp": "03:06:36", "text": "仅此一项。内森总是告诉我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11198.55, "timestamp": "03:06:38", "text": "我应该和我的人民在一起吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11202.07, "timestamp": "03:06:42", "text": "时机终会到来。我感觉很奇怪。我的 sk"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11205.03, "timestamp": "03:06:45", "text": "感觉皮肤像着火了一样。怎么回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11207.91, "timestamp": "03:06:47", "text": "这是血吗？这是告别。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11211.51, "timestamp": "03:06:51", "text": "嗯，没关系。这是番茄酱。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11214.87, "timestamp": "03:06:54", "text": "是的。草莓。草莓酱。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11218.23, "timestamp": "03:06:58", "text": "是的。他听到“哦，他听到‘哦’了。”"}]